cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "De novo cysteine protease design pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A computational pipeline for the de novo design of cysteine proteases built
  around a Cys-His-Asp catalytic triad and an oxyanion hole, combining
  all-atom RFdiffusion backbone scaffolding and partial diffusion,
  ProteinMPNN sequence design under Rosetta FastRelax and catalytic
  constraints, and three rounds of AlphaFold3 apo/complex confidence and
  structural-agreement filtering.
authors:
  - family-names: Choi
    given-names: Hojae
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
